[129.703527, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[1G\u001b[KThe bug is the loop condition while lo < hi. When the search space narrows to a single element (lo\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K== hi), the loop exits \u001b[3mwithout ever checking\u001b[23m that element \u2014 so any target that lands at the final\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kconverged position (like the last element) is missed. Fixing it to lo <= hi:\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[2m[Checkpoint cp-1794591477956-2: /tmp/ami-demo-dOvSdg/bug.py]\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25bc \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan file_edit(/tmp/ami-demo-dOvSdg/bug.py) +1 -1 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K  \u001b[38;5;35m\u2713\u001b[39m \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;167mfile_edit\u001b[39m\u001b[22m\u001b[2m \u00b7 \u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;243m/tmp/ami-demo-dOvSdg/bug.py\u001b[39m\u001b[2m \u00b7 \u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;35m(+1 -1)\u001b[39m\u001b[2m \u00b7 \u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;35m113 tok\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;243m  \u23bf  diff \u00b7 \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;75m/tmp/ami-demo-dOvSdg/bug.py\u001b[39m\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[K\u001b[2m0  [edit: bug.py, 4 lines changed]\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[K\u001b[2m1  Successfully edited /tmp/ami-demo-dOvSdg/bug.py\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[K\u001b[2m2  \u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[K\u001b[2m1  def binary_search(arr, target):\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[K\u001b[2m2      \"\"\"Return the index of target in sorted arr, or -1 if absent.\"\"\"\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[K\u001b[2m3      lo, hi = 0, len(arr) - 1\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[7G\u001b[K\u001b[2m\u001b[22m-     while lo < hi:  # \u001b[32mBUG:\u001b[39m should be `lo <= hi`\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[K\u001b[2m\u001b[22m4+     while lo <= hi:\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[K\u001b[2m5          mid = (lo + hi) // 2\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[K\u001b[2m6          if arr[mid] == target:\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[2m\u2502  7              return mid\u001b[22m\r\r\n\